WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:20.000
DESK-HEAD: Quick briefing before the print, everyone stop what you are doing for a minute.

2
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Priya: Go ahead, I am listening.

3
00:00:40.000 --> 00:01:00.000
DESK-HEAD: The whisper number circulating on the desk is running two tenths above consensus.

4
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:20.000
Priya: Two tenths is enough to move the front end pretty hard if it prints that way.

5
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:40.000
DESK-HEAD: Agreed, so I want everyone to flatten two's tens risk into the print, no exceptions.

6
00:01:40.000 --> 00:02:00.000
Priya: Understood. What about the belly positions we are already carrying?

7
00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:20.000
DESK-HEAD: Same rule, flatten what you can, reduce what you cannot flatten in time.

8
00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:40.000
Priya: I have a decent five year position from this morning, I will start working it down now.

9
00:02:40.000 --> 00:03:00.000
DESK-HEAD: Good. Also, nobody shows size below the five year until we see the actual number.

10
00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:20.000
Priya: No size below five year, understood, I will pass that to the rest of the desk.

11
00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:40.000
DESK-HEAD: If the whisper is right this could be a risk-off tone for the rest of the session.

12
00:03:40.000 --> 00:04:00.000
Priya: Should we widen quotes across the board or just pull back on size?

13
00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:20.000
DESK-HEAD: Pull back on size first, only widen if liquidity actually dries up after the print.

14
00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:40.000
Priya: Makes sense, I will hold off on widening unless we see it in the order book.

15
00:04:40.000 --> 00:05:00.000
DESK-HEAD: One more thing, if the print surprises hard, expect a wave of client calls right after.

16
00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:20.000
Priya: I will make sure someone is covering the phones through the release, not just watching screens.

17
00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:40.000
DESK-HEAD: Good call. Let's regroup right after the number drops and reassess.

18
00:05:40.000 --> 00:06:00.000
Priya: Sounds good, I will have the flatten done well before the release.
